e="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;layout&quot;:&quot;dropdown&quot;,&quot;submenu_icon&quot;:{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;&lt;svg aria-hidden=\&quot;true\&quot; class=\&quot;e-font-icon-svg e-fas-caret-down\&quot; viewBox=\&quot;0 0 320 512\&quot; xmlns=\&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=\&quot;M31.3 192h257.3c17.8 0 26.7 21.5 14.1 34.1L174.1 354.8c-7.8 7.8-20.5 7.8-28.3 0L17.2 226.1C4.6 213.5 13.5 192 31.3 192z\&quot;&gt;&lt;\/path&gt;&lt;\/svg&gt;&quot;,&quot;library&quot;:&quot;fa-solid&quot;}}" data-widget_type="nav-menu.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <nav class="elementor-nav-menu--dropdown elementor-nav-menu__container" aria-hidden="true"> <ul id="menu-2-e72a44b" class="elementor-nav-menu"><li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-43"><a href="/current-students" class="elementor-item" tabindex="-1">Current Students</a></li> <li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-44"><a href="/faculty-staff" class="elementor-item" tabindex="-1">Faculty/Staff</a></li> <li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-45"><a href="/about/alumni-foundation/" class="elementor-item" tabindex="-1">Alumni</a></li> <li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-18330"><a href="https://rose.edu/rsc-parent-family-hub/" class="elementor-item" tabindex="-1">RSC Parent &amp; Family Hub</a></li> </ul> </nav> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </nav> </div> </div> </div> </div> </header> <main id="content" class="site-main post-14664 page type-page status-publish hentry"> <div class="page-content"> <div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="14664" class="elementor elementor-14664" data-elementor-post-type="page"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4d09237 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="4d09237" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"> <div class="e-con-inner"> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8f11fd0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="8f11fd0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"> <div class="e-con-inner"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0a9334 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e0a9334" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8ee2168 elementor-widget elementor-widget-wp-widget-bcn_widget" data-id="8ee2168" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="wp-widget-bcn_widget.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="breadcrumbs" vocab="https://schema.org/" typeof="BreadcrumbList"><span property="itemListElement" typeof="ListItem"><a property="item" typeof="WebPage" title="Go to Rose State College." href="https://rose.edu" class="home"><span property="name">Rose State College</span></a><meta property="position" content="1" /></span> &gt; <span property="itemListElement" typeof="ListItem"><a property="item" typeof="WebPage" title="Go to Current Students." href="https://rose.edu/current-students/" class="post post-page"><span property="name">Current Students</span></a><meta property="position" content="2" /></span> &gt; <span property="itemListElement" typeof="ListItem"><a property="item" typeof="WebPage" title="Go to Student Services." href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-services/" class="post post-page"><span property="name">Student Services</span></a><meta property="position" content="3" /></span> &gt; <span property="itemListElement" typeof="ListItem"><span property="name" class="post post-page current-item">Raider Care</span><meta property="url" content="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-services/raider-care/" /><meta property="position" content="4" /></span></div> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-32ba190 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-page-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading" data-id="32ba190" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-page-title.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Raider Care</h1> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ed8a91f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="ed8a91f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-abf2e2c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="abf2e2c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <p>Raider Care is a partnership between Rose State College and Community Health Centers of Oklahoma that provides convenient, affordable healthcare. Located in the Raider Care &amp; Resource Center, Raider Care offers comprehensive services, including primary care, lab work, case management, and support programs for students and the surrounding community. Open to patients of all ages, the clinic accepts most insurance plans and offers a sliding fee scale for uninsured individuals, ensuring quality care is accessible to everyone.</p> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d4f2655 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="d4f2655" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-button-wrapper"> <a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://www.communityhealthok.org/"> <span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"> <span class="elementor-button-text">Patient Registration and Appointments</span> </span> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-57947ab elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="57947ab" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;all_collapsed&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys"> <details id="e-n-accordion-item-9180" class="e-n-accordion-item"> <summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9180"> <span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Raider Care FAQ </div></span> <span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'> <span class='e-opened'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewbox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span> <span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewbox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span> </span> </summary> <div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-9180" class="elementor-element elementor-element-c34b6ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c34b6ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65f63af elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="65f63af" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <ol><li>When does the Health Center open?<ul><li>April 6<sup>th</sup>, 2026</li></ul></li><li>Do I have to be a Rose State Student to be seen at the Health Center?<ul><li>No, the services are open to the public.</li></ul></li><li>How do I schedule an appointment?<ul><li>Call our phone number 405-807-0087.</li></ul></li><li>Is Community Health Centers of Oklahoma a free clinic?<ul><li>No, Community Health Centers of Oklahoma is a local, nonprofit clinic that provides affordable, comprehensive healthcare, especially underserved populations, regardless of insurance or income.</li></ul></li><li>How much am I expected to pay at my appointment?<ul><li>If insured, your Health Insurance copay. If uninsured, the copay is determined by your income &amp; family size.</li></ul></li><li>What services are provided at the center?<ul><li>We offer medical care, lab services, case management, and Healthy Start services.</li></ul></li><li>What insurance plans are accepted?<ul><li>We accept all insurance plans and welcome uninsured patients under a Sliding Fee Schedule.</li></ul></li><li>If I am currently uninsured, can someone assist me in applying for an insurance plan or help me renew my insurance coverage?<ul><li>Yes. Case Managers are on-site to assist with your insurance needs.</li></ul></li><li>What can I expect during my first visit?<ul><li>New patients will receive over 20 lab tests as part of their initial intake.</li></ul></li><li>How can I complete registration forms?<ul><li>Registration forms can be completed online at communityhealthok.org or in the office at the time of your visit.</li></ul></li><li>What is the 340B prescription drug program?<ul><li>Patients can utilize the 340B program to access outpatient drugs at significantly reduced prices.</li></ul></li><li>Where can I use the 340B prescription drug discount?<ul><li>While you may use any pharmacy you prefer, 340B discount pricing is only available at Walgreens located at 4300 SE 29<sup>th</sup> Street, Del City, OK 73115, or Walgreens at 1601 S. Air Depot Blvd, Midwest City, OK 73110.</li></ul></li><li>Are patients of all ages accepted?<ul><li>Yes, our providers see patients of all ages.</li></ul></li></ol> </div> </div> </div> </details> </div> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0d89272 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0d89272" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51ff577 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="51ff577" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-70c0b30 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="70c0b30" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h4 class="elementor-widget-container">Hours</h4></div><ul><li>Monday &amp; Wednesdays 8 AM &#8211; 5 PM</li><li>Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays 3 PM &#8211; 6 PM</li><li>Fridays &#8211; Closed</li></ul><h4>Contact Us</h4><p>Call: 405-807-0087 | Email: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9be9f4e8fedbf8f4f6f6eef5f2efe2f3fefaf7eff3f4f0b5f4e9fc"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="64160b170124070b0909110a0d101d0c010508100c0b0f4a0b1603">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><h4>Location</h4><p>Raider Care &amp; Resource Center</p><p><br />6012 Prosper Blvd, Midwest City, OK 73110</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f0371d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="f0371d8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Counseling</h2> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e01898e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e01898e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <p>The Counseling Center at Rose State College provides comprehensive mental health services for all students, faculty, and staff. Visit the <a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-services/raider-care/counseling/">Counseling page</a> for more information.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f1518ca e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f1518ca" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-332052a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="332052a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c71c86f elementor-widget elementor-widget-wp-widget-advanced_sidebar_menu" data-id="c71c86f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="wp-widget-advanced_sidebar_menu.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="advanced-sidebar-menu-wrap wp-widget-advanced_sidebar_menu-wrap" id="wp-widget-advanced_sidebar_menu-wrap" data-js="wp-widget-advanced_sidebar_menu-wrap"><ul class="parent-sidebar-menu" data-level="0"><li class="page_item page-item-145 current_page_ancestor menu-item has_children current-menu-ancestor"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/">Current Students</a><ul class="child-sidebar-menu" data-level="1"><li class="page_item page-item-1492 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/semester-schedules/">Semester Schedules</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1564 menu-item has_children"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-login/">Student Login</a><ul class="grandchild-sidebar-menu level-0 children" data-level="2"><li class="page_item page-item-4772 menu-item has_children"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-login/mfa-multi-factor-authentication-on-the-college-sso/">MFA (Multi-Factor Authentication) on the College SSO</a><ul class="grandchild-sidebar-menu level-1 children" data-level="3"><li class="page_item page-item-4796 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-login/mfa-multi-factor-authentication-on-the-college-sso/mfa-faq/">SSO MFA FAQ</a></li> </ul> </li> <li class="page_item page-item-4798 menu-item has_children"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-login/login-faq/">Login FAQ</a><ul class="grandchild-sidebar-menu level-1 children" data-level="3"><li class="page_item page-item-5118 menu-item has_children"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-login/login-faq/password/">Password</a></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </li> <li class="page_item page-item-1583 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/student-dining/">Student Dining</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1588 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/housing/">Housing</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1593 menu-item has_children"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/academic-financial-records/">Academic &#038; Financial Records</a><ul class="grandchild-sidebar-menu level-0 children" data-level="2"><li class="page_item page-item-1598 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/academic-financial-records/transcript-request/">Transcript Request</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1602 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/academic-financial-records/articulation-transfer-agreements/">Articulation (Transfer) Agreements</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1760 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/academic-financial-records/academic-forgiveness/">Academic Forgiveness</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1761 menu-item"><a href="https://rose.edu/current-students/academic-financial-records/academic-status/">Academic Status</a></li> <li class="page_item page-item-1763 menu-item"><a 